# Fungus1_32 from the entry from below (the Knight settles at x 10.0, y 3.39) to the top gate into Fungus1_20_v02 (x 66 to 70, y 40). The Battle Gate Bones (x 18, x 54.7, floor level) are open at load in the port, so they are planned open.
# Planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc (HK_WALKPLAN_MARGIN=0.4, sync poll) with the whole run before it as the pre, 2026-11-03.
at 10.00 3.39
wait 90
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
loop c32-h001 until expr abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_X) - 1026949) <= 58982 && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 222167) <= 19661 max 3 timeout 900
walk 12.49
walk 12.06   # run-up
walk 12.49   # take-off
hold right+cross for 8
hold right for 15
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
end
fight 4 9.25 75.25
snipe
guard 2
retreat 9.25 75.25
heal
